  "caption": "Instrumental original handheld JRPG mystery cue in E minor, 5/4, 122 quarter-note BPM. Preserve the complete supplied 16-bar independent melody, varied phrase rests, explicit scene-specific support and bass. oboe lead with pizzicato support. Clean restrained timbres, no extra notes or reharmonization, no distortion, vocals or fade.",
  "form_description": "16 bars in 5/4 grouped 3+2: eight-bar oboe climb with uneven silences; four-bar high cello clearing; four-bar oboe answer. The melodic trip begins with a minor-third leap followed by a descending semitone.",
